    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Bing Sai Chuan retorts that even without controlling fate Gu, it can be used as a Gu refinement material to refine destiny Gu, and that destiny Gu can be controlled where fate Gu cannot. Duke Long asks whether refining destiny Gu means fate Gu will not exist; narration notes that if fate Gu is used as material when Longevity Heaven refines destiny Gu, fate Gu would be used up, and a new fate Gu could still appear later.",
        "chapters": [
          1961
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fate-as-material",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_duke_long"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Red Lotus’ will tells Fang Yuan that even though fate Gu is destroyed, using it as Gu material to refine destiny Gu still needs an otherworldly demon like him. Bing Sai Chuan sees that Red Lotus Demon Venerable also seems set to refine destiny Gu, against Longevity Heaven’s goal.",
        "chapters": [
          1962
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fate-as-material",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Red Lotus’ will gives Fang Yuan the Immortal Gu recipe of destiny Gu among other gifts. The incomplete recipe was created according to the destiny song Fang Yuan will create in the future, and Red Lotus converted it into a rank nine destiny Gu recipe to help him comprehend destiny song in its initial form.",
        "chapters": [
          1965
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fate-as-material",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_recipe"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "During the battle, using human wills as Gu material to refine destiny Gu is called wishful thinking, yet still a possible method. Under destiny song, human wills and flames merge into a formless, colorless mystical Gu material. Fang Yuan later realizes Red Lotus wanted to refine destiny Gu but was not truly trying to refine a Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1966
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-refinement-session",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Heavenly Court’s Gu Immortals stop chasing after witnessing Fang Yuan refine destiny Gu in front of them.",
        "chapters": [
          1970
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-refinement-session",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
